// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2798457843" "Hello. I've got some information for you."
// Answer Text :
"P1939340389" "Ask about information."
// Answer Text :
"P1195468855" "Ask about the weather."
// Answer Text :
"P1250699819" "Threaten to beat informant"
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P3447255354" "This world is full of super villains. They want to do evil things like take over the world."
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P1407234927" "I think it's going to rain tomorrow."
// Answer Text :
"P1443913718" "Try again."
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P1781926359" "Alright, Alright. I'll tell you everything I know."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - PoweredClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2085042185" "Powered Terrorists"
// DetailString :
"P1594180194" "These 'terrorists' are dressed like powers division members, though, they don't seem to be from around here."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - EscapeClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1040494836" "Escape Plan"
// DetailString :
"P586031633" "According to Praetor Sinclair he had intercepted a Resistance plan to free some recently apprehended prisoners. He wasn't aware that you had apprehended some powered terrorists and that they were in Praetor Tilman's hands.<br><br>With your reporting of their capture, Sinclair is certain that the Resistance was talking about breaking the prisoners out of the Asylum rather than the BAF. He sent the T.E.S.T. strike team to the wrong destination, you need to intercept the escaping prisoners in the tunnels!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - PrimalHeroClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P967026898" "Primals"
// DetailString :
"P4236628392" "One of the resistance members mentioned the term 'Primal'. What does that mean?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P440923678" "Unregistered powered individuals have been spotted in the ranks of the Resistance. We've detected their presence in a warehouse in Lambda Sector. I need you to bring these subversives to me."
// SendOffString :
"P3615375008" "Be aware, these individuals work with a terrorist group not local to Praetoria City. Concentrate on capturing the powered individuals, they will be the ones who possess the information I want. Do with the others as you wish."

